{"version":1,"content":"<p>TVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》將於周日（25日）播出第8集，延續「心跳電話亭」環節。</p><p>12位求愛勇者將爭取與何沛珈、陳若思（Amber）、郭珮文（Juliana）、梁超怡及陳星妤單獨相處15分鐘，透過主題考驗及交談增進了解。</p><p>女嘉賓亦可主動邀請任何一位求愛勇者進入電話亭，不受對方有否上前爭取所限。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T05:54:59.425968+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":151,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:22:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T22:57:39.352073+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:49:17.218750+00:00","content_hash":"e3f43b35b8cfdc4d9f49140ed5102d710b1b3bc1c548a414ebd86b97a7aace4d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}